            <div xml:id="d526">

                <pb facs="0856" n="728" xml:id="pg728"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">714.1515/591: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Minister in Guatemala</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Geissler</hi>) <hi
                        rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of
                    State</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Guatemala</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1928-03-22T13:00:00-06:00"><hi rendition="#italic">March 22,
                                1928—1 p.m.</hi></date><lb/>[Received 4:57 p.m.]</dateline></opener>
                <p>26. I have communicated the contents of the Department’s March 21, 7 p.m., to
                    President Chacon orally and to the Foreign Office by memorandum.</p>
                <p>The President says that the matter will be considered this afternoon at special
                    meeting of the Cabinet and that the decision will be communicated to me
                    immediately.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Geissler</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
